This licence covers the MindfulVerse source code only. The Qur'anic content
bundled with it is not covered and keeps its own terms:

- English translation: ClearQuran by Talal Itani, CC BY-NC-ND 4.0
  (https://www.clearquran.com). Shown word for word, with credit, for
  non-commercial use only.
- Arabic text, Ibn Kathir's commentary and related datasets: from the Quranic
  Universal Library by Tarteel (https://qul.tarteel.ai), under its terms.
- Arabic typeface: KFGQPC Uthmanic Hafs, King Fahd Glorious Qur'an Printing
  Complex, under its terms.
- Music in the promo videos: "Alhamdulilah" by Jawad Syed, CC BY 3.0.

This includes the generated files in apps/web/public/data and their copies in
the mobile app.
